  "faqContactSupport": "CONTACT HUMAN SUPPORT",
  "faqQ1": "How do I upgrade to Premium?",
  "faqA1": "You can upgrade by clicking on the Profile tab or selecting any premium feature (like unlimited AI Chat). We support various payment methods including Chargily for Algerian Dinars.",
  "faqQ2": "Can I use Meducyte on multiple devices?",
  "faqA2": "Yes! Your data is synced to your account. Simply log in on your new device to continue your study journey.",
  "faqQ3": "How does Spaced Repetition work?",
  "faqA3": "Meducyte uses advanced algorithms to track your performance. We show you difficult questions more often and easy ones less frequently to optimize your memory retention.",
  "faqQ4": "What is the AI Medical Tutor?",
  "faqA4": "Medu-AI is our custom chatbot trained on medical literature. It can explain complex concepts, help you interpret labs, or guide you through clinical cases.",
  "faqQ5": "Does Meducyte follow the Algerian curriculum?",
  "faqA5": "Yes, our question bank and course structure are specifically designed to align with the curriculum modules of Algerian medical faculties.",
  "faqQ6": "How to start a Group Study?",
  "faqA6": "Head to the 'Productive Bay' and select 'Study Groups'. You can create a private group and invite your comrades via a unique code or link.",
  "faqQ7": "Is there a Meducyte community?",
  "faqA7": "Yes! Join our official Telegram channel to stay updated and discuss with thousands of medical students across Algeria.",
